        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVPRT, Portofino Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very sleek Fifth Avenue Plate With Portofino Lever made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants the Portofino Door Lever an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. The wave shaped lever is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVPRT Fifth Avenue Plate With Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Portofino Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-plate.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Plate With Portofino Lever, Grandeur FAVPRT",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVPRT, Portofino Door Lever - This very sleek Fifth Avenue Plate With Portofino Lever made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants the Portofino Door Lever an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. The wave shaped lever is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
